    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch05-01: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.59";
    dc:description "Large bounded spaces can be simulated now and give informative comparisons. No sampling scheme or dataset covers all simple programs, and conclusions depend on encoding and complexity definitions.";
